    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35333" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">per-paulus</span></b> , a, um, adj.,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>very little.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> As <i>subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">perpaulum</span></b> ,
				i, n., <i>a very
			little</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">loci,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. de Or. 2, 35, 150</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Adv.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">per-paulum</span></b> , <i>a very little indeed</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">declinare,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Fin. 1, 6, 19</span></i>
			.</div>
